+ 246  (41 * 6)
----
```

Now, I'll add up the partial products:

```
  41
x 61
----
  41   (41 * 1)
+ 246  (41 * 6)
----
  2521
```

So, the product of 41 and 61 is 2521.<answer>2521</answer>
